## 4. 资源与安全策略

```bash
# ① 容器资源
--memory=1g --memory-swap=0 \
--cpu-period=100000 --cpu-quota=50000 \
--pids-limit=512

# ② 隐藏硬件信息
apt install -y lxcfs
mkdir -p /var/lib/lxcfs/proc
# systemd unit 已随包提供

# docker run 示例
-v /var/lib/lxcfs/proc:/proc \
--security-opt seccomp=unconfined \
--userns=keep-id  # (可选 userns-remap)
```

* **Cloudflare Tunnel**：

  ```bash
  cloudflared tunnel create studyroom
  cloudflared tunnel route dns studyroom study.example.com
  cloudflared tunnel run --url https://localhost:443
  ```
* **Fail2ban**：监控 `/var/log/nginx/access.log`，配置 5 分钟内 10 次失败即拉黑。

