## 5. 数据库 Schema (SQLite)

```sql
-- users
CREATE TABLE users (
  id   INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  name TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,
  pass TEXT NOT NULL -- bcrypt 哈希
);

-- sessions (一行对应一台容器)
CREATE TABLE sessions (
  id        TEXT PRIMARY KEY,  -- cid (uuid4)
  user_id   INTEGER NOT NULL,
  started   INTEGER,           -- epoch ms
  expires   INTEGER,           -- epoch ms
  FOREIGN KEY(user_id) REFERENCES users(id)
);

-- messages
CREATE TABLE messages (
  id      INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  user    TEXT,
  sent_at INTEGER,
  text    TEXT
);

CREATE INDEX idx_messages_time ON messages(sent_at);
```

> **清理规则**：新插入消息后执行 `DELETE FROM messages WHERE id < (SELECT id FROM messages ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 1 OFFSET 100);`

